---
description: Rules for analytics, reporting, and metrics logic
globs: ["src/pages/**/*.{ts,tsx}", "src/components/**/*.{ts,tsx}", "src/lib/**/*.ts", "server/**/*.ts"]
---

Analytics rules:
- define metrics explicitly
- separate raw provider data from derived metrics where possible
- make date range and timezone assumptions explicit
- avoid mixing calculation logic with presentation formatting
- avoid silent aggregation errors
- preserve current reporting behavior unless changes are requested
- improve naming and clarity before introducing a new analytics architecture

When changing analytics code:
- identify source data
- identify derived calculations
- identify display formatting
- separate responsibilities incrementally when useful